<title>YUGOSLAVIA: Yugoslav January retail sales down 19 pct vs Dec.</title>
<headline>Yugoslav January retail sales down 19 pct vs Dec.</headline>
<dateline>BELGRADE 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistical Office reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> YUGOSLAV RETAIL SALES	JAN 97	 DEC 96	 JAN 96</p>
<p> pct change mth/mth	  - 19.0	  + 4.0	  - 5.0</p>
<p> pct change yr/yr	    + 35.0	  +51.0	 +137.0</p>
